{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>כי אם</b> (but if). And if illness befalls him, or this one or that one falls, his fellow will help him. And the word is like כי אם, and there is none like it, for כי אם in this book: 'Woe to you, O land' [Ecclesiastes 10:16]."], :book :ecclesiastes, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Wikisource" "https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%90%D7%91%D7%9F_%D7%A2%D7%96%D7%A8%D7%90_%D7%A2%D7%9C_%D7%A7%D7%94%D7%9C%D7%AA"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:27:32.102616368Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}